@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:deployment] authoritative-reviewed-hosts
Each machine MUST have one public host.json declaration under hosts/NAME.
Discovery candidates MUST remain separate until reviewed. Production declarations
MUST specify authenticated identity, stable disk membership and resource budgets;
private keys and plaintext credentials MUST NOT enter this tree.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:deployment] public-service-peer-routing
Public fleet service names MUST resolve through DNS rather than loopback or fleet
overlay aliases. A physical host MUST route every remote host or service address
on its provider subnet through the provider gateway instead of relying on direct
neighbour discovery.
